  "metadata": {
    "note": "Freely-licensed dish photographs on Wikimedia Commons, curated by hand so each image shows the named dish (mismatches rejected). Licence and author retrieved from the Commons API on 2026-11-27. Images are loaded from Commons at runtime (Special:FilePath, 960px); the app falls back to the illustration if a photo cannot load.",
